OL,3,GNEWSAMusical charts life of Derry nun
OL,4,Aon path to sainthood
OL,5,
OL,6,FA musical about nun Clare Crockett,
OL,7,Fwhose cause for sainthood is being
OL,8,Fconsidered by the Catholic Church, has
OL,9,Fbeen performed in her home city for the
OL,10,Ffirst time.
OL,12,FA Famous Nun: Clare Crockett - A Life
OL,13,FBrought to the Stage opened at St
OL,14,FColumb's Hall in Londonderry on Friday.
OL,16,FA second performance takes place on
OL,17,FSaturday, on what would have been
OL,18,FSister Clare's 44th birthday.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
